---
import CodeBlock from '../CodeBlock.astro';
import Callout from '../Callout.astro';
import DocSection from '../DocSection.astro';
import DocImage from '../DocImage.astro';
import DocList from '../DocList.astro';
---

<article class="doc-article">
  <h1 class="doc-article__title">Design System</h1>

  <p class="doc-article__intro">
    Guía completa de tokens de diseño, tipografía y componentes del sistema visual
    "Engineering Notebook". Todos los valores están disponibles como CSS custom properties.
  </p>

  <!-- Color Tokens -->
  <section id="color-tokens">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Color Tokens</h2>
    <p>
      La paleta se divide en tres grupos: <strong>Base</strong> (fondos oscuros),
      <strong>Syntax</strong> (resaltado de código) y <strong>Accents</strong> (estados UI neón).
    </p>

    <div class="doc-color-grid">
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #0f0f11;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--bg-void</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#0f0f11</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #18181b;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--bg-surface</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#18181b</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #fde047;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--accent-yellow</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#fde047</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #f472b6;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--accent-pink</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#f472b6</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #22d3ee;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--accent-cyan</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#22d3ee</span>
      </div>
      <div class="doc-color-swatch" style="--swatch: #86efac;">
        <div class="doc-color-swatch__color"></div>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__name">--accent-green</span>
        <span class="doc-color-swatch__hex">#86efac</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <CodeBlock lang="css">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-keyword">:root</span> {
  <span class="token-comment">/* Base */</span>
  <span class="token-func">--bg-void</span>: <span class="token-string">#0f0f11</span>;
  <span class="token-func">--bg-surface</span>: <span class="token-string">#18181b</span>;

  <span class="token-comment">/* Neon Accents */</span>
  <span class="token-func">--accent-yellow</span>: <span class="token-string">#fde047</span>;
  <span class="token-func">--accent-pink</span>: <span class="token-string">#f472b6</span>;
  <span class="token-func">--accent-cyan</span>: <span class="token-string">#22d3ee</span>;
  <span class="token-func">--accent-green</span>: <span class="token-string">#86efac</span>;
}`} />
    </CodeBlock>
  </section>

  <!-- Typography -->
  <section id="typography">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Typography</h2>
    <p>
      El sistema utiliza cuatro familias tipográficas con roles específicos.
    </p>

    <div class="doc-table-wrapper custom-scroll">
      <table class="doc-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Fuente</th>
            <th>Uso</th>
            <th>Ejemplo</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code class="doc-inline-code">Inter</code></td>
            <td>Body text, headings de documentación</td>
            <td style="font-family: var(--font-sans);">The quick brown fox</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code class="doc-inline-code">JetBrains Mono</code></td>
            <td>Código, labels técnicos, rutas</td>
            <td style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">const x = 42;</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code class="doc-inline-code">Patrick Hand</code></td>
            <td>Notas, subtítulos, tooltips</td>
            <td style="font-family: var(--font-hand);">Nota al margen!</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code class="doc-inline-code">Permanent Marker</code></td>
            <td>Títulos de sección principales</td>
            <td style="font-family: var(--font-marker);">HEADER</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Components -->
  <section id="components">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Components</h2>
    <p>
      Componentes clave del sistema de diseño con sus especificaciones.
    </p>

    <h3 class="doc-article__h3">Botón Primario "Terminal"</h3>
    <p>
      Fondo blanco o negro con borde contrario. Fuente <code class="doc-inline-code">JetBrains Mono Bold</code>.
      Hover con desplazamiento <code class="doc-inline-code">translate(-2px, -2px)</code> + box-shadow duro.
    </p>

    <CodeBlock lang="css">
      <Fragment set:html={`<span class="token-keyword">.btn-primary</span> {
  <span class="token-func">font-family</span>: <span class="token-string">var(--font-mono)</span>;
  <span class="token-func">font-weight</span>: <span class="token-string">700</span>;
  <span class="token-func">border</span>: <span class="token-string">2px solid white</span>;
  <span class="token-func">box-shadow</span>: <span class="token-string">var(--shadow-white)</span>;
  <span class="token-func">transition</span>: <span class="token-string">all 0.2s ease</span>;
}

<span class="token-keyword">.btn-primary:hover</span> {
  <span class="token-func">transform</span>: <span class="token-string">translate(-2px, -2px)</span>;
}

<span class="token-keyword">.btn-primary:active</span> {
  <span class="token-func">transform</span>: <span class="token-string">translate(0, 0)</span>;
  <span class="token-func">box-shadow</span>: <span class="token-string">none</span>;
}`} />
    </CodeBlock>

    <Callout type="warning" title="Sombras">
      En este sistema NO usamos sombras difusas (blur). Solo sombras duras para
      dar sensación de "pegatina" o recorte de papel.
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- Accessibility -->
  <section id="accessibility">
    <h2 class="doc-article__h2">Accessibility</h2>
    <p>
      Todos los acentos neón cumplen con los ratios de contraste WCAG AA sobre fondo oscuro.
      Los estados <code class="doc-inline-code">:focus-visible</code> usan outline de
      <code class="doc-inline-code">2px solid var(--accent-yellow)</code>.
    </p>

    <Callout type="tip" title="Contraste">
      Usa siempre los colores de acento sobre fondos <code>--bg-void</code> o
      <code>--bg-surface</code> para mantener el contraste. Nunca combines acentos
      entre sí como fondo + texto.
    </Callout>
  </section>

  <!-- PLACEHOLDER: Añade más secciones con DocSection, DocImage, DocList -->
</article>

<style>
  .doc-color-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-block: 1rem;
  }

  .doc-color-swatch__color {
    width: 100%;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--swatch);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0 0;
  }

  .doc-color-swatch__name {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding: 0.375rem 0.5rem 0;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .doc-color-swatch__hex {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem 0.375rem;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm);
  }
</style>
